```js
function tokenize(q) {
  const s = String(q || '')
  const terms = []
  const latin = s.toLowerCase().match(/[a-z0-9_]{2,}/g) || []
  terms.push(...latin)
  const cjk = s.match(/[\u4e00-\u9fff]+/g) || []
  for (const run of cjk) {
    if (run.length <= 3) terms.push(run)
    else {
      for (let i = 0; i + 1 < run.length; i++) terms.push(run.slice(i, i + 2))
    }
  }
  return [...new Set(terms)].slice(0, 8)
}
```

Hmm for query "主要做开发" — bigrams: 主要 要做 做开 开发. Lines containing 开发 etc. Fine.

But careful: for conversation recall, the user's whole message is the query — long messages produce many bigrams. Cap at 8 terms; scoring: count how many distinct terms match line; rank by distinct-term coverage * length factor + recency.

```js
async function search(q, limit = 10) {
  const b = await init()
